{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Rancher: A New Life\u00a0 Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>free Demo version</strong> of <i>Rancher: A New Life</i>, featuring <strong>modified and limited content</strong> compared to the full release.<br>Get a taste of country life and explore the game\u2019s core mechanics before diving into the complete experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Available Features in the Demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Simplified demo campaign introducing the core mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 10 crops to grow in your vegetable garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 1 quad race track to test your driving skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b 2 shooting range mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 1 cooking level with a limited selection of dishes to prepare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf0 2 workshop projects to build and customize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 Simplified wood processing \u2014 cutting and chopping firewood for your fireplace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 Chicken care system (simplified \u2014 no petting interaction)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf6f Beehives with basic honey production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 Wild bird care \u2014 birdhouse, feeder, and water bowl</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9 Cleaning and renovating your home \u2014 both interior and exterior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude91 Simplified furniture placement with a smaller set of available items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Limited number of languages available in the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f Keyboard and mouse support only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64 Single-player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Limited accessible locations on map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 Mushroom picking in the nearby forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Basic photo mode with limited options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Grass mowing </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084090?t=1760090689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084090?t=1760090689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084090/1dc79ef46e65a25270a3d6f50a7e63c2de62ba01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760090689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084090/1dc79ef46e65a25270a3d6f50a7e63c2de62ba01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760090689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Rancher: A New Life\u00a0 Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>free Demo version</strong> of <i>Rancher: A New Life</i>, featuring <strong>modified and limited content</strong> compared to the full release.<br>Get a taste of country life and explore the game\u2019s core mechanics before diving into the complete experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Available Features in the Demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Simplified demo campaign introducing the core mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 10 crops to grow in your vegetable garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 1 quad race track to test your driving skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >